# The item menu's icons and descriptions, from the "items" quick save (tools/make_items_save.py makes it from
# out/bugsaves/battle-stuck, not committed). Title (Start), the quick load at VI 100, R opens the item menu,
# the stick moves the cursor right twice (the description changes, the highlighted icon moves), B closes it.
#   ELTALE_DATA_DIR=<copy> ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT=100 eltale-p1 --headless --fast --frames 400
#       --input tests/item-icons.input --rom ...
